# The Real Help — .clinerules (Part A)

## Business facts (the only facts you may use in copy)
- The Real Help, LLC, St. Louis, MO. https://therealhelp.com
- Builds custom software, AI tools and workflow automation for small businesses.
- **The Quick Fix:** $500 one time + $30/month. One real chore solved with a working tool, fixed price, live in weeks.
- **Custom Build:** fixed quote after a free intro call.
- Booking: https://cal.com/jason-griffin-0covhm | Phone: 314-660-2890 | Email: info@thecdscloud.com (the only working mailbox)
